# Note: The EXP codes contain a repeat count the poster left unresolved
#       (marked xxx / yyy); yyy = 660 decimal was reported to break the game.
#       For "MS unit swap", xxxxxxxx follows the production-list order,
#       starting at 825FCB64 (Gundam) and +0x60 per unit. Swapped units do
#       not appear in the encyclopedia or production list. The 2nd slot is
#       used because the 1st is occupied by the Carry Base.

